# Build-context hygiene (review XC-6). CI builds from a clean checkout and is unaffected; this
# stops a LOCAL `docker build -f server/Dockerfile .` from copying host artifacts over the image's
# own `npm ci` output (Dockerfile: COPY web/ ./) and from shipping hundreds of MB of context.
.git
.github
.claude
.superpowers
android
docs
scratchpad
screenshots
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
server/.venv
server/.pytest_cache
server/build
server/*.egg-info
web/node_modules
web/dist
web/smoke-shots
web/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
